        "text": "<thinking> To create the conditional_update.py file that applies a conditional or version-aware update to one stored document, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon DynamoDB as the external provider for this task. DynamoDB is a managed NoSQL document store provided by AWS, and it supports conditional updates using the ConditionExpression parameter. </thinking>\n",
